{"id":"n56616-1-10","stage":4,"title":"발라드 · 情歌","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56616-1-10-1","ko":"어떤 노래를 즐겨 들으세요?","zh":"您喜欢听哪类的歌曲呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个。","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"노래를","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래를","audio":"/audio/e4d8b71da5f5c71ee421.mp3"}},{"text":"즐겨","meaning":"喜欢，爱","explanation":"즐기다：喜欢，爱；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"즐기다","audio":"/audio/52a5578b574f2755fc41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91878","senseId":"2","lemma":"즐기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"즐겨","audio":"/audio/1d646d0dc22c7c9b9396.mp3"}},{"text":"들으세요?","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들으세요","audio":"/audio/c265b77443977dcce049.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]},{"id":"52a5578b574f2755","term":"즐기다","zh":"喜欢，爱","audio":"/audio/52a5578b574f2755fc41.mp3","entryId":"91878","definition":"喜爱做某事而经常做。","pronunciation":["즐기